tant temporal interval, fulfilling the requirement for Logic-Hardware Identity.Strategic Implications for Advanced AIAs AI architectures move toward deeper recursive loops, hardware-induced jitter becomes a primary source of logic failure. This project demonstrates that hardware can be "hardened" to match the needs of advanced, sovereign AI systems, ensuring that output remains deterministic regardless of physical thermal pressure.Proving the Core Root of SAIHVLine #001: SAIHV is anchored in a Stochastic Feedback Loop isolation model, ensuring that virtualized logic remains 1:1 with hardware-level deterministic states, effectively pruning non-deterministic noise before it reaches the execution layer.Invisible Protocol CheckPS C:\SAIHV\ROOT>
